UID:nianli-7-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270108
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 1.9 慎终追远
DESCRIPTION:论语 1.9：曾子曰：慎终追远，民德归厚矣。\nhtt
 ps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/9.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/9.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-8-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270108
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270109
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 1.10 夫子至于是邦
DESCRIPTION:论语 1.10：子禽问于子贡曰：夫子至于是邦也，
 必闻其政，求之与？抑与之与？子贡曰：夫子温良恭俭
 让以得之。夫子之求之也，其诸异乎人之求之与？\nhttps:
 //yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/10.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/10.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-9-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270109
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270110
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 1.11 父在观其志
DESCRIPTION:论语 1.11：子曰：父在，观其志；父没，观其行
 ；三年无改于父之道，可谓孝矣。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/
 xue-er/11.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/11.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-10-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270111
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 1.12 礼之用，和为贵
DESCRIPTION:论语 1.12：有子曰：礼之用，和为贵。先王之道
 ，斯为美，小大由之。有所不行，知和而和，不以礼节
 之，亦不可行也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/12.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/12.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-11-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270111
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270112
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 1.13 信近于义
DESCRIPTION:论语 1.13：有子曰：信近于义，言可复也；恭近
 于礼，远耻辱也；因不失其亲，亦可宗也。\nhttps://yikongl
 u.com/lunyu/xue-er/13.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/13.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-12-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270113
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 1.14 君子食无求饱
DESCRIPTION:论语 1.14：子曰：君子食无求饱，居无求安，敏
 于事而慎于言，就有道而正焉，可谓好学也已。\nhttps://y
 ikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/14.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/14.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-13-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270114
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 1.15 贫而无谄
DESCRIPTION:论语 1.15：子贡曰：贫而无谄，富而无骄，何如
 ？子曰：可也。未若贫而乐，富而好礼者也。子贡曰：
 诗云：如切如磋，如琢如磨，其斯之谓与？子曰：赐也
 ，始可与言诗已矣！告诸往而知来者。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/
 lunyu/xue-er/15.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/15.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-14-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270115
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 1.16 不患人之不己知
DESCRIPTION:论语 1.16：子曰：不患人之不己知，患不知人也
 。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/16.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xue-er/16.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-15-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270116
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 2.1 为政以德
DESCRIPTION:论语 2.1：子曰：为政以德，譬如北辰，居其所
 而众星共之。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/1.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/1.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-16-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270117
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 2.2、2.3 思无邪
DESCRIPTION:论语 2.2：子曰：诗三百，一言以蔽之，曰：思
 无邪。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/2.html\n\n论语 2.3：子
 曰：道之以政，齐之以刑，民免而无耻；道之以德，齐
 之以礼，有耻且格。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/3.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/2.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-17-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270118
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 2.4 吾十有五而志于学
DESCRIPTION:论语 2.4：子曰：吾十有五而志于学，三十而立
 ，四十而不惑，五十而知天命，六十而耳顺，七十而从
 心所欲，不逾矩。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/4.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/4.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
