UID:nianli-18-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270119
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 2.5 孟懿子问孝
DESCRIPTION:论语 2.5：孟懿子问孝。子曰：无违。樊迟御，
 子告之曰：孟孙问孝于我，我对曰无违。樊迟曰：何谓
 也？子曰：生，事之以礼；死，葬之以礼，祭之以礼。\n
 https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/5.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/5.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-19-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270120
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 2.6、2.7 孟武伯问孝
DESCRIPTION:论语 2.6：孟武伯问孝。子曰：父母唯其疾之忧
 。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/6.html\n\n论语 2.7：子游问
 孝。子曰：今之孝者，是谓能养。至于犬马，皆能有养
 ；不敬，何以别乎？\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/7.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/6.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
