DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270122
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270123
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 2.11 温故而知新
DESCRIPTION:论语 2.11：子曰：温故而知新，可以为师矣。\nht
 tps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/11.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/11.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
