DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270125
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 2.15 学而不思则罔
DESCRIPTION:论语 2.15：子曰：学而不思则罔，思而不学则殆
 。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/15.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/15.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
