DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270128
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270129
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 2.19 举直错诸枉
DESCRIPTION:论语 2.19：哀公问曰：何为则民服？孔子对曰：
 举直错诸枉，则民服；举枉错诸直，则民不服。\nhttps://y
 ikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/19.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/19.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
