DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270129
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270130
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 2.20 临之以庄则敬
DESCRIPTION:论语 2.20：季康子问：使民敬、忠以劝，如之何
 ？子曰：临之以庄则敬，孝慈则忠，举善而教不能则劝
 。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/20.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/20.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
