DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270131
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 2.21 子奚不为政
DESCRIPTION:论语 2.21：或谓孔子曰：子奚不为政？子曰：书
 云：孝乎！惟孝友于兄弟，施于有政。是亦为政，奚其
 为为政？\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/21.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-zheng/21.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
