SUMMARY:论语 6.8 伯牛有疾
DESCRIPTION:论语 6.8：伯牛有疾，子问之，自牖执其手，曰
 ：亡之，命矣夫！斯人也而有斯疾也！斯人也而有斯疾
 也！\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/8.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/8.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
