RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 6.13 孟之反不伐
DESCRIPTION:论语 6.13：子曰：孟之反不伐，奔而殿。将入门
 ，策其马，曰：非敢后也，马不进也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/
 lunyu/yong-ye/13.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/13.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
