DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270408
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 6.14、6.15 祝鮀之佞，宋朝之美
DESCRIPTION:论语 6.14：子曰：不有祝𬶍之佞而有宋朝之美，
 难乎免于今之世矣！\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/14.html\n\
 n论语 6.15：子曰：谁能出不由户？何莫由斯道也？\nhttps:
 //yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/15.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/14.html
