DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270409
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 6.16、6.17 文质彬彬
DESCRIPTION:论语 6.16：子曰：质胜文则野，文胜质则史。文
 质彬彬，然后君子。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/16.html\n\
 n论语 6.17：子曰：人之生也直，罔之生也幸而免。\nhttps:
 //yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/17.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/16.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
