RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 6.18 知之者不如好之者
DESCRIPTION:论语 6.18：子曰：知之者不如好之者，好之者不
 如乐之者。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/18.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/18.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
