UID:nianli-104-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270414
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270415
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 6.25 博学于文，约之以礼
DESCRIPTION:论语 6.25：子曰：君子博学于文，约之以礼，亦
 可以弗畔矣夫！\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/25.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/25.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-105-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270416
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 6.26、6.27 子见南子
DESCRIPTION:论语 6.26：子见南子，子路不说。夫子矢之曰：
 予所否者，天厌之！天厌之！\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-y
 e/26.html\n\n论语 6.27：子曰：中庸之为德也，其至矣乎！
 民鲜久矣。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/27.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/26.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-106-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270416
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270417
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 6.28 博施济众（能近取譬）
DESCRIPTION:论语 6.28：子贡曰：如有博施于民而能济众，何
 如？可谓仁乎？子曰：何事于仁？必也圣乎！尧舜其犹
 病诸！夫仁者，己欲立而立人，己欲达而达人。能近取
 譬，可谓仁之方也已。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/28.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yong-ye/28.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-107-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270417
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270418
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.1、7.2 述而不作
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.1：子曰：述而不作，信而好古，窃比于
 我老彭。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/1.html\n\n论语 7.2：子
 曰：默而识之，学而不厌，诲人不倦，何有于我哉？\nhtt
 ps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/2.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/1.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
