UID:nianli-108-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270418
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270419
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.3、7.4 德之不修
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.3：子曰：德之不脩，学之不讲，闻义不
 能徙，不善不能改，是吾忧也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu
 -er/3.html\n\n论语 7.4：子之燕居，申申如也，夭夭如也。\n
 https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/4.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/3.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
