UID:nianli-109-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270419
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270420
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.5、7.6、7.7 甚矣吾衰也
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.5：子曰：甚矣吾衰也！久矣吾不复梦见
 周公！\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/5.html\n\n论语 7.6：子曰
 ：志于道，据于德，依于仁，游于艺。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/
 lunyu/shu-er/6.html\n\n论语 7.7：子曰：自行束脩以上，吾未
 尝无诲焉。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/7.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/5.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
