UID:nianli-110-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270420
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270421
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.8、7.9 不愤不启，不悱不发
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.8：子曰：不愤不启，不悱不发。举一隅
 不以三隅反，则不复也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/8.htm
 l\n\n论语 7.9：子食于有丧者之侧，未尝饱也。子于是日
 哭，则不歌。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/9.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/8.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-111-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270421
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270422
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.10 用之则行，舍之则藏
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.10：子谓颜渊曰：用之则行，舍之则藏；
 唯我与尔有是夫。子路曰：子行三军，则谁与？子曰：
 暴虎冯河，死而无悔者，吾不与也。必也，临事而惧，
 好谋而成者也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/10.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/10.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-112-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270422
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270423
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.11 富而可求
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.11：子曰：富而可求也，虽执鞭之士，吾
 亦为之。如不可求，从吾所好。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu
 -er/11.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/11.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
