UID:nianli-113-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270423
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270424
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.12、7.13 子之所慎
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.12：子之所慎：齐，战，疾。\nhttps://yikong
 lu.com/lunyu/shu-er/12.html\n\n论语 7.13：子在齐闻韶，三月不
 知肉味。曰：不图为乐之至于斯也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lun
 yu/shu-er/13.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/12.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-114-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270424
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270425
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.14 夫子为卫君乎
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.14：冉有曰：夫子为卫君乎？子贡曰：诺
 ，吾将问之。入，曰：伯夷、叔齐何人也？曰：古之贤
 人也。曰：怨乎？曰：求仁而得仁，又何怨？出，曰：
 夫子不为也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/14.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/14.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-115-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270425
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270426
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.15 饭疏食饮水
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.15：子曰：饭疏食饮水，曲肱而枕之，乐
 亦在其中矣。不义而富且贵，于我如浮云。\nhttps://yikongl
 u.com/lunyu/shu-er/15.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/15.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-116-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270426
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270427
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.16、7.17 五十以学易
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.16：子曰：加我数年，五十以学易，可以
 无大过矣。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/16.html\n\n论语 7.17
 ：子所雅言，诗、书、执礼，皆雅言也。\nhttps://yikonglu.c
 om/lunyu/shu-er/17.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/16.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-117-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270427
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270428
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.18 叶公问孔子于子路
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.18：叶公问孔子于子路，子路不对。子曰
 ：女奚不曰，其为人也，发愤忘食，乐以忘忧，不知老
 之将至云尔。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/18.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/18.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-118-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270428
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270429
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.19、7.20 我非生而知之者
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.19：子曰：我非生而知之者，好古，敏以
 求之者也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/19.html\n\n论语 7.20
 ：子不语怪、力、乱、神。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/20
 .html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/19.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-119-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270429
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270430
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.21 三人行
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.21：子曰：三人行，必有我师焉。择其善
 者而从之，其不善者而改之。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er
 /21.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/21.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-120-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270430
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270501
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.22、7.23、7.24 天生德于予
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.22：子曰：天生德于予，桓魋其如予何？\
 nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/22.html\n\n论语 7.23：子曰：二
 三子以我为隐乎？吾无隐乎尔。吾无行而不与二三子者
 ，是丘也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/23.html\n\n论语 7.24
 ：子以四教：文，行，忠，信。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu
 -er/24.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/22.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-121-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270502
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.25 圣人吾不得而见之（得见有恒者）
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.25：子曰：圣人，吾不得而见之矣；得见
 君子者，斯可矣。子曰：善人，吾不得而见之矣；得见
 有恒者，斯可矣。亡而为有，虚而为盈，约而为泰，难
 乎有恒矣。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/25.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/25.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-122-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270502
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270503
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 7.26、7.27 钓而不纲
DESCRIPTION:论语 7.26：子钓而不纲，弋不射宿。\nhttps://yikong
 lu.com/lunyu/shu-er/26.html\n\n论语 7.27：子曰：盖有不知而作
 之者，我无是也。多闻，择其善者而从之；多见而识之
 ；知之次也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/27.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/shu-er/26.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
