DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270527
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270528
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.5 子畏于匡
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.5：子畏于匡。曰：文王既没，文不在兹
 乎？天之将丧斯文也，后死者不得与于斯文也；天之未
 丧斯文也，匡人其如予何？\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/5.
 html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/5.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
