DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270529
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270530
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.7 吾有知乎哉
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.7：子曰：吾有知乎哉？无知也。有鄙夫
 问于我，空空如也。我叩其两端而竭焉。\nhttps://yikonglu.c
 om/lunyu/zi-han/7.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/7.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
