DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270603
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270604
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.13、9.14 子欲居九夷
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.13：子欲居九夷。或曰：陋，如之何？子
 曰：君子居之，何陋之有？\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/13
 .html\n\n论语 9.14：子曰：吾自卫反鲁，然后乐正，雅颂各
 得其所。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/14.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/13.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
