DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270604
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270605
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.15 出则事公卿
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.15：子曰：出则事公卿，入则事父兄，丧
 事不敢不勉，不为酒困，何有于我哉？\nhttps://yikonglu.com/
 lunyu/zi-han/15.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/15.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-156-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270605
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270606
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.16 子在川上
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.16：子在川上曰：逝者如斯夫！不舍昼夜
 。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/16.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/16.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
