UID:nianli-157-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270606
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270607
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.17、9.18 吾未见好德如好色者
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.17：子曰：吾未见好德如好色者也。\nhttps
 ://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/17.html\n\n论语 9.18：子曰：譬如为
 山，未成一篑，止，吾止也。譬如平地，虽覆一篑，进
 ，吾往也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/18.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/17.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
