DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270608
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270609
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.22 后生可畏
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.22：子曰：后生可畏，焉知来者之不如今
 也？四十、五十而无闻焉，斯亦不足畏也已。\nhttps://yiko
 nglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/22.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/22.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
