UID:nianli-162-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270611
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270612
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.25 三军可夺帅也
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.25：子曰：三军可夺帅也，匹夫不可夺志
 也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/25.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/25.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-163-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270612
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270613
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.26 衣敝缊袍
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.26：子曰：衣敝缊袍，与衣狐貉者立，而
 不耻者，其由也与？不忮不求，何用不臧？子路终身诵
 之。子曰：是道也，何足以臧？\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-
 han/26.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/26.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
