UID:nianli-164-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270613
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270614
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.27 岁寒
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.27：子曰：岁寒，然后知松柏之后彫也。\
 nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/27.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/27.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-165-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270614
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270615
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.28、9.29 知者不惑
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.28：子曰：知者不惑，仁者不忧，勇者不
 惧。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/28.html\n\n论语 9.29：子曰
 ：可与共学，未可与适道；可与适道，未可与立；可与
 立，未可与权。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/29.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/28.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nianli-166-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270615
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270616
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 9.30 唐棣之华
DESCRIPTION:论语 9.30：唐棣之华，偏其反而。岂不尔思？室
 是远而。子曰：未之思也，夫何远之有？\nhttps://yikonglu.c
 om/lunyu/zi-han/30.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-han/30.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
