UID:nianli-203-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270722
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270723
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 12.3 司马牛问仁
DESCRIPTION:论语 12.3：司马牛问仁。子曰：仁者其言也讱。
 曰：其言也讱，斯谓之仁已乎？子曰：为之难，言之得
 无讱乎？\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/3.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/3.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
