UID:nianli-204-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270723
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270724
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 12.4 司马牛问君子
DESCRIPTION:论语 12.4：司马牛问君子。子曰：君子不忧不惧
 。曰：不忧不惧，斯谓之君子已乎？子曰：内省不疚，
 夫何忧何惧？\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/4.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/4.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
