DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270725
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270726
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 12.6 子张问明
DESCRIPTION:论语 12.6：子张问明。子曰：浸润之谮，肤受之
 愬，不行焉；可谓明也已矣。浸润之谮，肤受之愬，不
 行焉；可谓远也已矣。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/6.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/6.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
