DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270729
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270730
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 12.10 子张问崇德、辨惑
DESCRIPTION:论语 12.10：子张问崇德、辨惑。子曰：主忠信，
 徙义，崇德也。爱之欲其生，恶之欲其死。既欲其生，
 又欲其死，是惑也。诚不以富，亦祗以异。\nhttps://yikongl
 u.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/10.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/10.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
