UID:nianli-220-zh-Hans@yikonglu.com
DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270808
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270809
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 12.23、12.24 子贡问友
DESCRIPTION:论语 12.23：子贡问友。子曰：忠告而善道之，不
 可则止，毋自辱焉。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/23.html\n
 \n论语 12.24：曾子曰：君子以文会友，以友辅仁。\nhttps:/
 /yikonglu.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/24.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yan-yuan/23.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
