DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270821
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270822
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 13.19 樊迟问仁
DESCRIPTION:论语 13.19：樊迟问仁。子曰：居处恭，执事敬，
 与人忠。虽之夷狄，不可弃也。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-
 lu/19.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-lu/19.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
