DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270828
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270829
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 13.26、13.27 君子泰而不骄
DESCRIPTION:论语 13.26：子曰：君子泰而不骄，小人骄而不泰
 。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-lu/26.html\n\n论语 13.27：子曰：
 刚毅、木讷，近仁。\nhttps://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-lu/27.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/zi-lu/26.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
