DTSTAMP:20261115T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271001
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 14.46 原壤夷俟
DESCRIPTION:论语 14.46：原壤夷俟。子曰：幼而不孙弟，长而
 无述焉，老而不死，是为贼！以杖叩其胫。\nhttps://yikongl
 u.com/lunyu/xian-wen/46.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/xian-wen/46.html
