DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271004
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 15.2 赐也
DESCRIPTION:论语 15.2：子曰：赐也，女以予为多学而识之者
 与？对曰：然，非与？曰：非也，予一以贯之。\nhttps://y
 ikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-ling-gong/2.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-ling-gong/2.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
