DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271011
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 15.11 人无远虑
DESCRIPTION:论语 15.11：子曰：人无远虑，必有近忧。\nhttps:/
 /yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-ling-gong/11.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-ling-gong/11.html
