DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271021
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 15.29 过而不改
DESCRIPTION:论语 15.29：子曰：过而不改，是谓过矣。\nhttps:/
 /yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-ling-gong/29.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/wei-ling-gong/29.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
