RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:论语 17.23 君子尚勇乎
DESCRIPTION:论语 17.23：子路曰：君子尚勇乎？子曰：君子义
 以为上。君子有勇而无义为乱，小人有勇而无义为盗。\n
 https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yang-huo/23.html
URL:https://yikonglu.com/lunyu/yang-huo/23.html
